% ADJ52 case-8 — patient observations + queries.
% 46-year-old never-smoking man, referred for a second opinion on "poorly
% controlled asthma": one year of persistent wheeze, dry cough, small-volume
% episodic hemoptysis; no response to stepped-up ICS/LABA; afebrile, SpO2 95%;
% unilateral louder/constant left-chest wheeze that does not clear with
% coughing, reduced left air entry; normal bloods/CRP; plain film shows a
% smaller left lung; spirometry restrictive and non-reversible; bronchoscopy
% shows a smooth polypoid mass nearly occluding the left main bronchus.
% Same vocabulary as the rulebook. No rules here — observe + query only.

observe patient_age(forty_six_years)
observe patient_sex(male)
observe symptom(persistent_wheezing)
observe symptom(dry_cough)
observe symptom(hemoptysis_small_volume_episodic)
observe smoking_history(never_smoked)
observe treatment_response(no_improvement)
observe treatment_failure(maximal_inhaler_therapy)
observe denied_symptom(fevers)
observe denied_symptom(night_sweats)
observe denied_symptom(weight_loss)
observe oxygen_saturation(normal_room_air)
observe exam_finding(audible_wheeze)
observe wheeze_localization(left_chest_louder_constant)
observe wheeze_character(does_not_clear_with_coughing)
observe exam_finding(reduced_air_entry_left_side)
observe exam_finding(no_clubbing)
observe exam_finding(no_lymphadenopathy)
observe lab_crp(normal)
observe imaging_finding(asymmetric_lung_size)
observe imaging_finding(left_lung_smaller_than_right)
observe spirometry_finding(restrictive_process)
observe bronchodilator_response(no_meaningful_improvement)
observe procedure(flexible_bronchoscopy)
observe bronchoscopy_finding(smooth_polypoid_mass)
observe mass_location(left_main_bronchus)
observe mass_effect(near_complete_lumen_obstruction)

% q1/q2/q3 — most likely diagnosis displacing the asthma label
? diagnosis(bronchial_carcinoid_tumor)
? diagnosis(endobronchial_squamous_cell_carcinoma)
? diagnosis(benign_endobronchial_tumor_hamartoma_or_lipoma)
? diagnosis(bronchial_mucoepidermoid_carcinoma)
? diagnosis(endobronchial_foreign_body)
? diagnosis(refractory_asthma_true)

% q4 — next step / management of the endobronchial mass
? next_step(bronchoscopic_biopsy_for_histology)
? next_step(ct_chest_for_staging)
? next_step(surgical_resection)
